h is Nating. It can be found at the bottom in a small cave as they swim against the heavy stream but the fish cannot jump over the height of fall.\n\nMusic : Avash by Avash\n\ncamera : Canon 1300D , Canon 50mm f/1.8, canon 55-250mm f/4-5.6 IS STM, YI 2k, Feiyutech Vimble 2\n\nFollow me on -\n\n* Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/devilsy9c\n\n* Facebook Profile : https://www.facebook.com/jawadibnan33\n\n* Mail : jawad3323@gmail.com\n\n#bangladesh #remakri #thanchi #bandarban #winter", "channel_id": "UC_Du6kB3ateSUnXekr3JcWw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_Du6kB3ateSUnXekr3JcWw", "duration": 281, "view_count": 8659, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=87KwuOE6WG4", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["India", "Future", "Bangladesh vs india", "Food ranger bangladesh", "Bangladesh", "travel", "where to travel", "where to travel 2019", "vlog", "where to travel now", "2019 travel destinations", "travel in 2019", "cheap", "travel inspiration", "inexpensive", "places to go", "places to travel", "how to travel when i'm broke", "short film", "cinematic", "trailer", "videography", "iphone", "a7sii", "filmmaking", "video", "cinematic footage", "cinematography", "film look", "bangladesh", "bandarban", "nafakhum", "dihan chowdhury", "remakri", "falls"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 12, "like_count": 68, "channel": "Jawad Ibnan", "channel_follower_count": 572, "uploader": "Jawad Ibnan", "uploader_id": "@Devilsy9c", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@Devilsy9c", "upload_date": "20190317", "timestamp": 1552809495, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "87KwuOE6WG4", "full